# Build context for ffsim/cloud/Dockerfile (run from the repo root: docker build -f ffsim/cloud/Dockerfile -t ffsim .).
# That Dockerfile COPYs only ffsim/ and research/sim-data/, so send nothing else: without this file the context
# is the whole checkout (~115 MB of logs, other packages and .git) instead of ~20 MB.
*
!ffsim/
!research/sim-data/
# never needed inside the image
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
